      <h2>About Jambiani Scuba Center</h2>
      <p>Jambiani Scuba Center is a locally-run PADI 5-Star dive center on the southeast coast offering affordable guided dives to Mnemba Atoll and southeast coast reefs with a focus on local employment and community development. PADI courses from Open Water to Divemaster, daily Mnemba Atoll trips, and reef conservation programs. Beachfront location with own dive boat, equipment rental, and classroom. Profits support local marine conservation initiatives and community projects.</p>

